# --- Terraform ---
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it pins exact
# provider versions/checksums for reproducible clones and contains no
# secrets. Commit it (it appears after the first `terraform init`).
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# --- Runtime hand-off state ---
# state/azure.json holds the circuit's activation key; aws.json holds IPs
# and resource IDs. Folders are kept via .gitkeep.
state/*
!state/.gitkeep

# --- SSH keypairs (generated fresh per run) ---
keys/*
!keys/.gitkeep
*.pem

# --- Screenshots / captured test output ---
# Raw captures (ping/traceroute) contain real IPs and resource identifiers.
# Copy reviewed screenshots elsewhere for the article instead of committing.
screenshots/*
!screenshots/.gitkeep

# NOTE: config/credentials.env is intentionally NOT gitignored.
# It ships with REPLACE_ME placeholders. Real values are filled in locally
# for the duration of the experiment and MUST be reset to placeholders
# before this repo is pushed anywhere.

# --- OS/editor noise ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/